# Research Directory

This directory will contain research findings from Phase 2 (Expert Research).

## Expected Files

- `github-actions-artifacts.md` - GitHub Actions v4 artifact merge behavior
- `duckdb-platforms.md` - DuckDB platform naming conventions
- `pat-configuration.md` - PAT fine-grained permissions research
- `distribution-requirements.md` - Extension distribution requirements
- `edge-cases.md` - Edge cases and special considerations

These files will be created by the Expert Agent during Phase 2.
